# Lines the name audit (scripts/audit_names.py) lets through: path glob <TAB> regex.
# The matched words are removed from the line first; anything left that still says an old name fails.
# The Classic robot is a choice by that name (Settings › Maxie, character=classic).
*	(?i)classic[ _-]?robot
# The Classic robot itself: its geometry (antenna, screen face) is what it is.
web/mascot.js	.*
# Tests that check an old name is gone or rejected.
tests/test_voice.py	(?i)hey claude.*# retired
tests/test_maxie_api.py	(?i)wake_words.*hey claude
# "Ask my Claude": the words he might say to send a question to his Claude plan (routing, not a name for Maxie).
tests/test_ask_claude.py	(?i)hey claude, use my plan
# The audit itself: its pattern, these rules and its tests name the old names on purpose.
scripts/audit_names.py	.*
scripts/audit_names.allow	.*
tests/test_audit_names.py	.*
